### 1. 根据用户ID获取薪资列表 (预期返回2条记录)
GET http://localhost:5176/salaryer/list?userId=user-123
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 为另一个用户发放一笔新薪水
POST http://localhost:5176/salaryer/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-456",
  "amount": 8200.50,
  "payDate": "2025-08-15"
}

### 3. 删除一条预置的薪资记录
POST http://localhost:5176/salaryer/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "sal-003"
}
